<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets up emerging market bank.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets up emerging market bank.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust said on Wednesday it was setting up its Emerging Europe, Middle East &amp; Africa Merchant Bank (EEMA).</p>
<p>The bank, to be managed from London, will be the focal point of the firm's capital markets, local currency trading, finance, direct investment and advisory activities in those regions.</p>
<p>Bankers Trust said in a statement that the bank would be headed by senior managing director Jay Pomrenze.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7770 (fax +44 171 583 7239)</p>
